OL,5,G2205 The 1970s: Those Were the Days
OL,6,     F1970s life was a kaleidoscope of
OL,7,     Fcolour - except for the food -
OL,8,     Ffrom red, white and blue Silver
OL,9,     FJubilee street parties to the
OL,10,     FMulti-Coloured Swap Shop on
OL,11,     FSaturday morning TV. (Ep2/2)
OL,12,G2335 Taggart
OL,13,     FFour days after James Dillon is
OL,14,     Freleased from Barlinnie after
OL,15,     Fserving a life sentence, the body
OL,16,     Fof the police officer who
OL,17,     Fconvicted him is found in a burnt
OL,18,     Fout car.
